Meaning of dreaming that you make a fool of yourself
That is, generally, this type of dream symbolizes the fear of letting your feelings flourish, you prefer to reserve your intimacies and not say what you think out loud, unless you have too much confidence with someone. Likewise, you also find it difficult to speak in front of a crowd, perform acts in public, you hate being the center of attention.
Dreaming of making a fool of yourself by speaking in public
When it's your turn to show yourself in the crowd, you get nervous. If you have this dream with your relatives, it is associated with a lack of trust with them, it is difficult for you to open up to others but do not worry because little by little you will catch yourself and talk about anything.
If you make a fool of yourself alone and that embarrasses you, it means that you are not sure of yourself, you have a lack of self-esteem and you prefer solitude to company because you feel calmer.
Dreaming of making a fool of yourself but you don't care are good omens. You are independent, you do not care what they think of you, you can handle yourself and the prejudices of unknown people who only try to hurt you do not matter to you.
Pooping yourself is one of the most ridiculous situations you can imagine, so if you have an excruciating fear of speaking in public or being the center of attention, it is very likely that your mind dreams of that situation to face extreme ridicule. You can also see more information in the meaning of dreaming about excrement and poop.
Another very common option when dreaming of making a fool of yourself is to do it with a silly fall in public. Who has not dreamed that?
If that is your case, your subconscious is warning you that be careful with the important decisions of your life and that you take the time to reason and make the right decision. You do not comment on an error as in the dream, be calm and meditate before deciding.
If the person who is exposed is someone else and not you, the meaning changes sides. You have no complexes, you show yourself as you are, sincere, honest, with security and clear ideas.
Reading other people's stories helps to interpret one's own.
