Usually a dream about cemeteries actually it is not associated with bad omens about sickness and misfortune. It simply means that you are a person full of curiosity, that you like to investigate what you do not know precisely.
The word has its origin in the Christian belief according to which in the cemetery the bodies of the deceased slept until the day of the resurrection. Initially in Castilian it was named «cemeterio» 'but with the passage of the centuries an interspersed n was added to the term.
One possibility is that you approach that place while you sleep to see the grave of a loved one that you miss. Would you like it take that contact again and dreaming it in part can satisfy that need.
It has happened to me and I wake up calm because I have spoken with someone I have not seen for a long time. There are people that find relaxation next to their dead relativesThat is why it is normal to dream of a cemetery with tombstones, a pantheon and niches of well-known people.
