In the dream, I approached the cemetery where we buried him. I went to the marble tombstone and saw that on it was written the message "Rest in peace."
Then the marble tomb was opened and my brother who was dead came out and I began to talk to him about the projects and dreams that I had in mind and that I could not tell him when I was alive. I wish I dreamed of that pantheon every day.
As you can see, in no case is the interpretation related to illness and bad omens or even to dream about zombies or ghosts. Our friend told me how good it felt to be able to reconnect with that person she loved so much.
