1.1 Dreamlike interpretations of the garbage (with rats and worms, rotten, on the floor ...)
Normally, it is interpreted as a vision that you have of yourself at the level of consciousness . If you regret having done something, acted wrong, you will feel dirty inside and have a nightmare where you are full of garbage, or the sea there are only waste bags, dirty water, worms (learn more about dream about garbage worms) and cockroaches.
Dreamlike interpretations of the garbage (with rats and worms, rotten, on the floor ...)
There is something near you that you do not want (a person, your job, a credit) and you try to get rid of it by washing yourself. The same is true when you are mopping the floor at home or in the bathroom.
It is usually associated with a jealous behavior, anger and envy.
Are you pissed off at someone who has beaten you in a sports competition?
Let me give you some advice: call him and ask for forgiveness. It's also a sign of personal transformation or maturation (when you don't pick it up), where you throw away bad memories and keep the best parts of your life.
Dreaming that you are eating garbageIt is interpreted as a symptom of repression. You are accepting something involuntarily.
Dreams about trash strewn in the river or in the sea. The water is filthy, full of flies and you either look at that filth, or you are in it.
Do not throw papers or cigarette butts on the ground, respect the green areas and take care of your environment.
