2 Other interpretations of dreams with owls or owls
Owls symbolize your ease of adapting to changesFor example, if you have left your job to carry out your work in another company, or if you have had to move to another city for personal reasons. You may be overwhelmed with these changes at first, but you will end up adjusting and getting the positive side of growing personally and taking advantage of the good side of experiencing new things.
However, the meaning can go further, since it also indicates your capacity for intuition and deductive intelligence.
Nocturnal birds of prey are also indicative of a nostalgic personality, who frequently returns to his past to remember his happy childhood. Since we were little, we have seen a lot of owls and owls in children's stories, while as adults we study them in school or we see them in documentaries.
Are they awake or asleep?
Do you suffer from insomnia or do you have difficulty sleeping at night?
If in your dream a owl awake that means shortly you're going to unmask someone that is betraying you.
