| Dreams with friends
In life, there are a number of things that everyone is going to have at some point; one of them are friendships. That is why dream with friends it is completely normal, and the fact that it is so common in society implies that there is meaning behind it.
The analyzes and the answers vary considerably depending on the context of the dream, since it is not the same if the subconscious is showing you friends you play with and have fun withWhat if it teaches you friends passed away because you miss them. Therefore, it is necessary that you read it carefully and take into account your personal situation, which will also influence the conclusion you reach in the end.
