You should try to think about the size of the alligators; if they were big, or small. The bigger it is, the bigger your worries, especially if every time you dream about them they get bigger.
They can be accompanied by spiders, snakes, snakes, or many insects. To get a more accurate interpretation, it is important that you read the interpretations of each animal / insect individually.
It is indicative that there are two people fighting over you. It is also possible that you are one of those two alligators, and that you are fighting to get a job, or to win the favor of the person you love.
Color… As we have already mentioned, color also has an influence. If the crocodiles are white, this is related to the purity of our soul.
Usually, if the crocodiles do not attack you, it denotes that the dreamer is an innocent person, because in the end they can attack you in the same way if the water is transparent, there should be no problem.
