What does it mean to dream about wasps?
5 Dreaming that a wasp is chasing you
7 Dreaming that a swarm is chasing you
As when we interpret any type of dream, it is advisable to be careful before trying to find the definitive interpretation. There can be many problems that affect the quality of your sleep, and that you are not aware of this.
It may be that an enemy tries to do you some damage, and your own subconscious is warning you of it. It is time to turn around and act.
If a dream appears nest of wasps that fly around you This will mean that there are many people in your circle of acquaintances who feel envy, who wish you badly or who are capable of failing in everything you set out to do.
Dreaming that a wasp is chasing you
If they manage to catch up with you during sleep, this means that you are not doing all you can to ward off worries.
Although it also tells us that we do not have to give up.
Dreaming that many wasps are chasing you and trying to guide them . It symbolizes that you intend to leave behind the toxic friendships that are weighing you down.
If the dream shows you a wasp nest that does not attack you but you do not do anything This will mean that you feel resentment for something that has been done to you, or it is simply a reflection of the way you act in your life, and that it should change.
