They explain that associated with happiness, joy, a time of fulfillment where everything works smoothly and you wake up with a smile every day. You are hopeful in your relationship and your business pays off, which makes you see the bright side of things.
This feeling of optimism causes you to even smell the pollen of the flowers. But the question is: how long will this freedom and joy last?
Although this is the most "general" meaning, there are many more contexts that will vary the dream interpretation.
If you dream of flowers that are dying or drying, that means your fear that a relationship gets boring. Next we will see other variants according to the best renowned psychologists and authors.
Dreaming of a bouquet of flowers is directly related to the event that accompanies this bouquet. If it is a bouquet from a funeral then something negative has happened in your life, but if it is a bouquet from a Marriage anniversary then it is something totally positive and that generates a joy when remembering.
What color are they?
Blues, violets, lilacs and purples, oranges ... All of them beautiful that symbolize a open attitude to the future, an omen full of joy and good luck and with new challenges to face as the arrival of a baby or more responsibilities in your job (and a higher salary). You are good at buffering changes in life.
Inside you hide a different character, with people you like to pretend. The best thing you can do is start being yourself.
