2 Other interpretations and symbols of an elephant
If you are in an African country, in India or where the mammal is a religious symbol, it is interpreted that you feel respect towards him. On the other hand, if you are European or American, it can represent respect for others, majesty, emotional maturity.
It could mean your desire to take a trip (read more about dream of traveling). It is also important to remember its size or color.
Dreaming that you are traveling on top of an elephant . When you get on the animal and start moving with it, it means that you are an independent person, with the ability to decide for yourself.
Dreaming of dead or injured elephants , or with killing one. It is interpreted that you do not know how to grow personally, or your incompetence when it comes to getting resources for your business.
You do not care about the means as long as you reach success as quickly as possible. Ambition is good, but don't turn it into greed because you will have nightmares.
When they are babies like Dumbo, it means that you are eager to bring a baby into the world. You want to have children with your partner.
Are they running, playing or swimming in the water?
Swimming in a river or a blue sea symbolizes freedom, relaxation and the happiness of being able to take a break. Have you been promoted for your good work?
Read more about dreaming about Water o with the sea.
If you dream of a very large animal, it indicates that your efforts are being rewarded and you will be able to get on its back to see everything from a higher height. Enjoy your deserved achievements.
Dreams with white elephants are the symbol of purity. It means that you have a collaborative and generous personality..
If they are blue, your main interest is work, and reds or pinks indicate that you care about your love life more than anything.
If you are going through a time full of problems and doubts in your life, it is normal for the subconscious to express anger.
If you have had a similar or different dream with this animal, tell us about it in the comments as well as the interpretation you gave it so that we all understand our mind better.
