4 Dreaming of giant waves that do not reach you
Experts agree that dreams about waves mean there is going to be a big change in your life, but it is not possible to specify if it is going to be positive or negative. Your mind has identified those little details and is now able to show you in pictures while you sleep.
In addition to this interpretation, we have to know more about the context of the dream, and consider your state of mind at the time you had it. Details can make a difference, and more so in this type of dream that admits so many variations.
Were they very big waves?Dream of giant wavesit can represent a trace of your personality. Maybe you have a very high ego and think that you can control everything.
If you are able to overcome the waves, see the horizon above them, it means that you will be able to rise above the problems and overcome them.
Dreaming of giant waves that do not reach you
If very large waves appear in your dream that want to catch you, but you manage to escape or they are so far away that they do not reach you, experts say that this means that even if you have misfortunes on the horizon you will be safe from them. He has known how to protect you against it and now you have nothing to fear.
