What does the subconscious tell us when dreaming about pee?
It means that you are going through a stage of sadness and even depression. An emotional crisis caused by situations that you have not been able to solve, which lowers your self-esteem, creates anxiety and causes these nightmares.
Dream of being naked and pee in public it means that you feel observed by the rest, that you do not have enough privacy for certain personal matters. As we grow, we become independent, however, some parts of our lives put privacy in question.
I dream that I drink my own pee
This dream may seem like a nightmare because urine is disgusting, but it has a positive aspect: represents your self-critical capacity to detect your flaws and improve every day to be a better person, instead of constantly flattering yourself.
Dreaming of abundant dog or cat pee means that perhaps you are not taking enough care of your pet, so you should pay more attention to him, get him more out for a walk and let him relieve himself. In any case, it is important that you verify that your dream does not mean anything else by entering our articles about dream about dogs y dream about cats.
If apart from urinating you also pooped, it is interpreted as ashamed that you feel for some aspect of your life It is so great that you would be very afraid if that part of you becomes public. The time has come to get rid of complexes once and for all, don't you think?
It is associated with your maternal instinct, since you care about the well-being of your child, you want him to grow up healthy and happy. On the other hand, the subconscious could be sending you a signal that you haven't changed her diaper, so you'll wake up and do your homework.
