The color of scorpions
The color of the scorpion is also very important. They are usually black or brown and are usually related to impure or dishonest acts.
If the scorpion is red that means you are going to betray your partner. It is a symptom of perseverance to achieve something regardless of the means you use along the way.
As with the big ones, if the scorpion manages to sting you in any area of the body, it means that your fear is so great that you are actually imagining one break up with a couple, a deception or serious infidelity. If the scorpion bites you and you notice how you are poisoning you should consult your doubts and talk to him about your fears to resume the night's rest.
In the case of dreaming of killing the scorpion it is an indication of your sentimental strength to deal with obstacles that come your way. When you achieve kill a scorpion, you show your strength, as well as your drive to solve those problems that worry you every night.
Again, represent your aptitude for cope with adversity in order to return to sleep like a baby.
You accept any deception with resignation, doing nothing to prevent it. You should change this attitude from now on, as it will take its toll on you in the future.
