It is normal that you dream of an abortion if your gynecologist has given you the news that you will not be able to get pregnant or that you will have a hard time doing it. But do not be alarmed, even if it is your problem, medicine is advancing and many women have been able to carry a baby inside without problems even when the doctor said it would not be easy.
