If you have dreamed of killer whales and sharks . This dream usually appears when you are in a time of great stress, or as an indication that you are behaving badly with other people (you may not remember your friends, or that you are being very arrogant with them).
Now that you know what this message means, it is time to reconsider, to think about the mistakes you have made and to ask for forgiveness.
If you have dreamed of whales, dolphins and killer whales So we are in a pretty positive case, since these mammals are peaceful.
