If you have dreamed of dead whales It means that you are a person who wants to get hold of his goals no matter which path you take, who he can crush during it.
You should apologize before things can get worse: it could affect your friends and even your love relationships.
If the whales were happy while jumping through the sea ... it is a good omen, as it means that you are about to receive important news or a positive omen.
