When you dream of dead spiders It means that you have overcome the problem or that you're about to get over it. On the other hand, if it is alive, the meaning depends on what was explained above.
If they are in your head, it is because your concern is psychological. Instead if they are in the body While you sleep, the worry is more physical… probably because of an infidelity.
A dream perhaps a bit unpleasant, but it symbolizes that you will be able to defeat all your enemies. However, it is something that will not happen immediately and, to achieve it, you cannot cause harm to anyone.
