At this point it is important to differentiate what we call clean water, which is water that is not dirty, from what is crystal clear water. The latter is so called, when it is exceptionally clean and without impurities, since the dream with crystal clear water it already has a different meaning.
If during sleep you see yourself drinking clean water from a spring, it is because you feel calm with yourself and you are on the right course in life: you will have health and money.
If you dream that you swim in the water it symbolizes inner peace and that you do good deeds for humanity. If you are at sea I recommend you read the meaning of dreaming about the sea.
If you have simply dreamed of a drop of clean water, it means that slowly you are externalizing your feelings and soon your loved ones will know them.
If during sleep you drink clean water, it means that you are in good health moment, you do sports and the subconscious reflects it to you with well-being.
If you dream that you are at the source of a river and the water is crystal clear, it means happiness for the beginning of a love relationship, for the reconciliation of a friendship or a new trip in a business.
When you dream of a lot of clean water, in abundant quantities, it is an indication of fertility and feeling of new life.
There are only bad omens when you dream that you drink clean water and it has a bad taste, which is usually associated with you have a toxic person near you that is hurting you, you need to get away from your problems and take care of your body.
The same happens if that water is burning and you burn yourself when you drink it. You need to take care of all those people around you and be very careful, because in the long run they can turn into the worst nightmares.
If you have dreamed that you jump down a slide and fall into clean water, it is interpreted as you have everything under control and you're on the right track Another possible meaning is that you are letting yourself be carried away by intuition and you are losing the reins of your life, so you need to step up and make decisions about your future. Finally, if when falling down the slide you have a feeling of vertigo, it symbolizes lack of control.
When you dream of drinking natural mineral water it is interpreted as that you are reaping the fruits of your actionsand you grant yourself the prize of savoring the reward of your good deeds.
Because it is true that floods can show certain problems. But in this case, dreaming of a flood and clean water, symbolizes that these problems will be solved sooner than you think.
Si you dream of clean water but indoors, it could be a move. But in addition, it can bring with it other meanings such as that you feel a little overwhelmed by some important issue that occurs in your home, which is drowning you.
If you see that the sea has taken over your house, it also has a new symbolism. In this case, the water has to be clean and with this we will talk about the fact that there is something very important that is happening in your life right now.
Si you dream of water that is escaping or running, then it symbolizes that you cannot control emotions. Because of this, you have become a very impulsive person.
Which gets you out of where you've been stuck and may be the start of something really good. It has so much to do with personal relationships as with your work life, but it is always a positive message.
But we do not always see this action in the dream, rather we can dream of a glass of clear water. This comes to bring us another meaning such as that you are going to be lucky in business or work, since it implies money.
