In general, dream interpretations of spiders are negative in Western people, since there is a lot of phobia towards this animal eight-legged and many people dream of spiders. However, there are cultures where an arachnid supposes prosperity and wealth, a symbol of the effort that will translate into the achievement of objectives.
But there are more possibilities, here are some examples: If there are many spiders in the bed that climb on your body and bite you , indicates that a fear in you grows every day, usually due to an event in your daily life.
Also, if you are making a lot of mistakes in your job, the sting would symbolize the fear of imminent dismissal.
Furthermore, If during sleep you defend yourself from the furry animal, it means that in real life you struggle to find solutions to everything that worries you.
Protect yourself well from everyone and don't trust people who have recently gotten too close to you. On the other hand, if it bites another person, you should ask yourself if it is you who is acting badly, causing harm to a friend or family member.
The subconscious is very clever and never betrays us. He wants to tell us something, so pay attention to all the details.
