If while you sleep you start to see how these living beings cling to your hair or head, it could have different meanings. First of all, sAnd interpret that lately you have too many worries running through your head, especially when there are many mites that invade it.
It is also very frequent dreaming of ticks that suck your blood.
A very unpleasant nightmare that, to solve it, you must raise your doubts with the suspect or investigate him.
Again, the interpretations are very diverse. When these animals grab onto your body and you kill them, it indicates that you are trying to solve all the difficulties that arise in life.
Sometimes the nightmare gets worse and you dream that ticks are entering your body.
It can also mean that you need to give more of yourself to feel like you've achieved success in your job. The most demanding people have this dream as a consequence of their inner ambition.
If you notice that they are going for your blood, the problem is of a sentimental nature. Your partner is trying to sabotage your life, or is unfaithful in the relationship.
If you love him, don't let him get away. Additionally, it may be the case that you see them in the head of another person, such as your child.
If you see the walls collapse, it can be a symptom of financial problems: you need liquidity as soon as possible so you don't lose your home.
White mites symbolize purity. Any dream of a white animal is a sign of a clean soul, free from fear, full of virtues.
If they are dead, it is interpreted as that you feel envy or hatred for another person. Dreaming of dead ticks is an indication of impurities and deep down it shows an inferiority complex on your part, especially when you feel disgusted to see them, if you have given too much importance to the moment.
The subconscious shows this state of happiness by showing you how you remove mites from a dog. that hurt him so much.
Other parts of the body where they can appear is in the mouth, feet, hands or even the ear, which is the same as having them on the head.
