The general interpretation is associated with uncertainty, especially when they are very high and incomplete. In fact, they can turn into a nightmare if as you go up or down you realize that they are endless, or they break.
Another interpretation may be due to the fact that you have a meticulous personality, that progresses little by little in the achievement of its objectives but you always make the right decision. The same happens when you dream of ants.
In love relationships you go little by little, you evoke romanticism and until you feel repaired you do not climb the last step. In business you are also conventional, slow not to fall and eat all the wooden steps with your mouth.
