In addition to the more common dreams that we have already seen, there may also be other important variations, such as the following.
You are married and your partner is unfaithful
If you dream that you have married but your partner cheats on you with a friend or coworker then you have to know what it means dreaming that your husband or wife cheats on you. The most common is that you fear that that infidelity come trueand that you may have reason to think this.
It is a good sign, since it is interpreted as that you love your partner so much that, if you lose it, your life would completely lose its meaning. But if the nightmare happens again, you should vent to a friend, or seek professional help.
If your partner showed up while you were getting married, or if he married her, it means that you miss her. You may even think you made a mistake ending the relationship.
