6 I have dreams of elevators that go up horizontally
In general, dreaming of an elevator is related to a person who is propose small goals daily that do not require much effort (experts relate it to the opposite of edream of climbing stairs). If you reason them, you will see that it makes sense: let's say that when you go up in an elevator it will be the device that is in charge of doing everything and you will only let yourself be carried away by its system of pulleys that will raise and lower you.
As in any other dream, there are many possible interpretations: depending on the context and the cover you are living at that moment, the meaning can change. It will not be the same as dreaming that you have been trapped in an elevator, that you simply get on one and arrive at your destination.
It may be that in the dream you are going up and the elevator is stopped on one of the floors, that you cannot move from there until they rescue you. The most normal thing is that some time passes and that nobody comes for you.
This represents the complete opposite of the dream that we have already seen in the previous point. The faster the elevator goes up, the better indicative it will be that everything is going well, that you are reaping all the fruits of your work in business and that relationships are going to go very well for you.
If you dream of a rotating elevator it can be interpreted as existing something in your life that won't let you live, which makes you restless and affects your sleep. It may be that you are actually spinning in your sleep and that the dream is simply a manifestation of this way of acting.
The dream of an elevator that falls without stopping is very common in people with vertigo or claustrophobia.If they do not suffer from these disorders, it also occurs in individuals who do not control their life, who have little stability in different factors and a lot of fear of what is to come. In this case, you should take a look atdream of falling into the voidsince quite possibly your case is also related to this dream.
These elevators are indicative that you are not moving forward in life; No matter how hard you try, your decisions are not going to get you anywhere. It is worth it that you start risking because otherwise you will not achieve anything.
Dreams with panoramic elevators have completely different interpretations, since it will vary according to the sensation that the dream itself gave you. In the event that you were uncomfortable because there were people watching you from the outside, it is associated with the existence of insecurities that will have to be resolved, which affects you too much what others tell you.
