What does it mean to dream of Church?
2 More dream interpretations and symbols of churches and cathedrals
If you continually wonder if God really exists, a dream of a Christian church would be normal.
If you see how the cathedral is full of darkness , it means that you try to hide from some aspects of your life. You are looking for peace to rest.
Do you need to confess? If in your church dream You approach a priest and ask him for confession, it is interpreted that remorse is brewing within you that does not allow you to sleep peacefully.
Did you argue with your partner and hurt him?
I advise you to offer a sincere apology if you really care about that person. If not, you may have nightmares with the devil (see what it meansdream of the devil).
They convey the message of a god and then act according to other directives. That is why many think that the Church is a pure business, a way to control people, to keep them innocent and ignorant through dogma, since at no time do they promote critical or rational thinking.
This can lead you to dream about ruined churches, which collapse because their arguments contradict themselves. In the end, an abandoned ruin remains.
I would love that you write your experiences, as well as your own interpretations about what you dreamed of in the comments.
