What reason was there for me to attack you?
You have not tried to face them and now it is taking its toll on your hours of rest. It's like a kind of remorse that keeps you from sleeping, that bites you every night until you face your phobias.
You imagine a tailcoat collector chasing you and the businessmen behind those companies biting you like dogs to get you to pay them the money you owe them.
If you have dreamed that you are bitten by a puppy without teeth and it does not hurt you, it means that your problems are not so serious How do you imagine. However, I recommend that you read more about dream about puppies for more information.
