2 Dream of big or small toads
4 Dreaming of living or dead toads
Is he alive or dead?
If the subconscious shows you toads of many colors, it is interpreted that you have seen your future partner but you have not realized. Your mind feels excited and happy to have found her, but you probably never know who she was until she crosses your path again.
If you dream of yellow toads means you have ambition to get a lot of money (gold and yellow are very similar).
On the other hand, if they are red, it symbolizes your fear of going into the red. Again, try to cut down on unnecessary expenses.
The green ones are the normal ones and have no special meaning because of the color.
