2 Dreaming that you find money that you have saved
4 I dream that I find wet money
6 Dreaming that you find lost money
8 You have dreams of finding fake money
We may be going through financial difficulties, and we need an economic "extra": in this case the money that appears in the dream would be great for us. It may also be that we have yet to create a company but we do not have enough capital to do so.
If you dream that you find money that you had previously saved, this means that your mind reminds you that you should have saved money in the past since at this moment you need it or you will need it for the more immediate future. It is also an indicative that gives you clues about what is to come.
The interpretation of this dream should be studied according to the action you do next.
Si you decide to keep it, even knowing who it is, this is synonymous with the fact that you are a greedy and selfish person. In a way it's like you stole it.
If you have come across wet money, indicate that we are talking about money that is not very useful, that surely you do not need it or you need more money than you have really found. The joy of money is diminished by the fact of being wet, which makes us see that it does not really solve any problem for us.
We may have problems paying the mortgage or more that we have received a bill with a very high amount, or that a debt starts to grow and we can't pay it. Our mind tells us that the time has come to see how we are going to approach it to avoid completely ruining us.
In in the dream you find a long series of images in which you find yourself with lost money, it is very likely that your mind is warning you that there is something around you that doesn't quite work or that, at least, it does not do it in the way you would have imagined. It can also be associated with success, with being about to get what you've wanted for so long.
In the dream, did you find jewels in addition to money?
You have dreams of finding fake money
Your mind may be telling you that you've scammed someone in some way. It is time to seek him out and ask for his forgiveness.
