1 What can we interpret from dreams with lice?
7 Dream about dead lice
9 Dreaming of lice on someone's head
11 Video of the meaning of dreaming about lice
In general, dreaming of posh is showing us intimate people, people from our environment who due to life circumstances they are making us feel guilty of a situation that we have not caused.
These nasty insects are capable of taking over our dreams and nightmares and turning them into a real martyrdom even more so if we are prone to fears of bugs. It is advisable to overcome these fears as soon as possible to ward off these types of dreams and be able to rest easy.
Dreaming of very large lice The size of these annoying bugs will indicate us at all times the severity of the problem or the closeness of the person who is causing us, the bigger the problem or the more closeness.
If you dream that you are eliminating lice, it means that you are unconsciously fixing your problem. Give your full attention to the dream and strive to remember it in the morning as your problems can be solved by following that path.
Dreaming of lice on someone's head
Dreaming that we remove lice from someone
If we are seeing lice on the head of another person, he needs our help, he is generally linked to a close relative, a brother, a son, a nephew, do not stop paying attention to them.
