Have you dreamed that your girlfriend is in prison?
If we dream that we got out of jail, it means something good: we got rid of our fears and in life we will do well both in love and at work, although some end up envying us. If, in addition to being in jail, you dream that you are isolated or in chains, it means that you feel extremely repressed, powerless for not being able to face the threats that make you small.
