2 Do you still have feelings for your ex?
6 Video about what it means to dream that you are back with your ex
Experts conclude that dreams in which we return with a previous partner are related to unfinished business, although it will also depend on the context in which we have the dreams, as well as on the behavior. It can also represent certain events in our life that have not yet occurred and that will eventually occur.
What happened to make the relationship fall apart?
After all, the final interpretation ofdream about your ex It will depend on how you felt at the time you had the dream. Think about how the reunion with your ex was, you will be happy, if you will feel something for each other, or if there was only left is to talk and close old wounds.
If you recently had a dream in which you had sex with your ex, it surely means that you miss being intimate with that person And your subconscious is fighting those feelings. Having erotic dreams with an ex partner is normal but it is very rare that it is related to a purely sexual attraction feeling and usually hides a need for affection towards that person that you have not forgotten.
If you have also dreamed of your ex in any situation, you can take advantage of the comments to tell readers what this dream meant to you.
We hope that this information about dreaming that you return with your ex has been interesting. Remember that you can also find other dreams in the category of dreams that start with the letter V.
