1 Dream about your own pregnancy
5 Dreaming that you are pregnant and it is not real
7 I dream that I am happy to be pregnant
9 Dream of seeing the delivery
11 Video of the meaning of dreaming about pregnancy
Dreaming about your own pregnancy does not necessarily have to mean that you are going to get pregnant: It means that you are facing a period of emotional maturityand that you are going to have to take care of a new responsibility soon. It may also be that your personal relationship with your partner is improving.
If someone else has dreamed of pregnancy and this does that you feel envy it is not a positive dream. Your own mind does not let you rest by being at all times thinking about what others have and you do not have.
Babies relate with innocence, with defenseless beings that will always require the care of another person. Having a child is considered a gift, so dreaming of twins, or triplets, is considered a double or a triple gift.
Those skilled inmeaning of dreams agree that the interpretation in this case is related to problems with a friendship. You may have argued with a friend or family member or life circumstances have caused you to stop talking to each other.
Dreaming that you are pregnant and it is not real
I dream that I am pregnant but I am a virgin
