2 Dream about gold or silver coins
At the symbol level, a coin has more value than a banknote. With this in mind, dream interpretation experts agree that dreaming of coins refers to you don't have enough money like to pay your whims, and your mind shows them to you as the need you have to get money and meet your expectations.
Dream about gold or silver coins
If the coins have been manufactured in silver, although also indicate ambition, they will not be as high as if they were made of gold. These currencies are much more common in most countries.
In the event that the dream shows you many coins in your hands, it will mean that you are spending a lot of money, and that that money would have been great to pay the bills at the end of the month. On the other hand, if in the dream you found them lying on the floor, it means that you have financial problems to make ends meet.
If you are a collector, you may be wanting to get a new coin to complete your collection, or a very valuable banknote that you wanted to buy but that, due to different circumstances, did not get to do so. If they do not collect coins, perhaps your own mind is telling you that it is time to search a new hobby to escape from the routine, or to fill that free time in which you do not know what to do.
If the reason for picking them up is because they fell out of your pocket, even if you can't pick them up, you should think about how to save more to avoid being so bad when the end of the month comes. If you pick up bills from the ground it means that you have managed the money well you were counting on, that you will be able to pay all your debts.
This dream interprets with the need to take a trip, with knowing new places that can stimulate your mind and help you find yourself again. Seeing foreign symbols on coins alludes to the desire you have to know the world.
If this article aboutwhat does it mean to dream of bills or coins It has helped you to solve your doubts, it would not be bad for you to see toodreams that start with Mto find out other possible meanings to help clear your mind.
