Comments: This provides an insight into the number of comments being posted under your videos daily.
Retention: This metric helps in identifying the spots when most of your viewers drop off.
Keywords: This provides the major keywords which are driving views and visits to your channel.
Sources: This metric provides an overview of the external platforms and websites driving views to your channel.
