A monthly subscription offers background play of music and videos, downloads, access to YouTube Originals, YouTube Music Premium, and all advertisement free. Many of the users are wise enough to use ad-blockers on their personal computers.
The benefits of Premium is best enjoyed by YouTube subscribers who regularly depend on the platform for their video content. It is hard to understate how great the benefits are if you spend a significant time on YouTube.
