Into Kildare name new Chief Experience Officer
After a six-week search, Into Kildare has selected its first ever Chief Experience Officer to help promote the county online to a global audience.
“I’m delighted to have been chosen as Kildare’s new chief experience officer and I can’t wait to get started,” said Stephen.
As Kildare’s first ever Chief Experience Officer, Stephen will be able to access a full calendar of events and a range of exclusive experiences throughout the year.
