Travel 32km from Dublin to find Clane, an attractive town overlooking the River Liffey in County Kildare. Explore the historic ruins of the medieval Bodenstown Church, discover the hidden oasis of Coolcarrigan House & Gardens, or cycle the country roads and soak up the stunning landscape.
